            "notes": "## Powers\n### Recommend\n* [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0)\nThis will do a ton of damage and will help you to confirm more kills\n\n### Alternative\n* [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3)\nThis is really good as an defensive Power. It will trigger Inspire for you and your allies around you, even if you don't do damage and will recharge your shield aswell and that increases your survivability\n\n## Items\n### Important\n* [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d)\nThis will allow you to do a lot more damage and you can hit insane far hits\n* [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51)\nThis is the first Main Item that will stay till the end\n* [Omni-Boost](item_632bd990-4523-4b3f-b08a-6dd11280c6f9) \nThis is the second Main Item that will stay till the end\n\n### Useful\n* [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf)\nThis can help you to survive area damage like the Rockets of [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9) \n\n#### If you have a lot of cash\n* [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e)\nThis is very good, if you get out of Repairpacks all the time and can use ur normal Flail a lot\n* [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)\nIf you use your normal Melee a lot, this will be a very good addition\n* [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)\nIf you use your normal Melee a lot, this will be a very good addition",
